cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "quantum-exercises: hands-on Qiskit exercises, from an empty laptop to real IBM hardware"
abstract: >-
  A rustlings-style command line course of twelve exercises for learning quantum
  computing with Qiskit. Answers are verified by inspecting the Qiskit objects a
  learner's code produces, comparing states and operators up to global phase and
  measurement counts against statistical tolerances, rather than by comparing
  source text or program output.
type: software
